part tsb_8
  tally 2
  law
  note "TSB-8 · The tax withheld is final: TSB-5's withholding ends the tax on the interest, which is not stated in the holder's return (.1)."

source tsb_8 "Treasury Savings Bonds, terms of issue, TSB-8 The tax withheld is final (tmp/cases/law/acts.md)"

input tsb8_final: bool question "Does the tax withheld on a redemption end the tax on the bond's interest (TSB-8 .1)?"

version tsb8_v1
  cite tsb_8
  governs 2018-01-01..
  known 2017-11-20
  enters 2018-01-01
  note "TSB-8 v1, in force 2018-01-01 until replaced, published 2017-11-20; governs redemptions from 2018-01-01."
